  "summary": {
    "kind": "quote",
    "span": {
      "end": 773,
      "end_line": 18,
      "line": 18,
      "start": 475
    },
    "text": "A role that writes \"I'll check back in 20 minutes\" has no clock and no way to wake. Nothing happens unless something outside the model makes it happen. This spec adds that something: a **timer** is a wake the daemon keeps. It is stored on disk, shown to the operator, and fires as an ordinary task."
  }
